se  you can sell them your product too but  the way to get started at the very  beginning is not to spend money you  don't have to spend money to make money  you just have to get out there and start  talking to your ideal customers let them  know what you're all about  children you can help them and work on a  small project okay when you're working  with your first customer if you don't  have a lot of experience a lot of  background  if you're coming in with a big pitch a  big expensive pitch it's risky  they're probably going to say no there's  a lot of people that they may need to  talk to just find one simple small thing  that you can do to help them whatever  their biggest pain point is just one  little thing that you can work on and  then over deliver like crazy so you  don't have to write a proposal you don't  have to make a sales pitch you're  helping them with one small thing and if  you over deliver like crazy you want  them saying wow that guy was so good  I wonder there's anything else that you  did help us out with and you're in and  you're going to get more deals and more  deals on more deals and you can increase  your prices and then you can launch new  products but the way to get started is  to start a service and don't spend money  until you're making money believe who's  been watching like the video give it a  thumbs up below let me know what you  think  leave a comment ask the question bill in  the comment section and click on my face  to subscribe to the channel thank you  guys so much I'll see you soon
 

